# Run r1102b, rerun boot B: fresh group B world (prep_srv.sh OUT_RB rb B spawn-animals=true: seed 8675309, structures
# on), default config (wildCrops on). Probes: zz_zq_probe.js (prep_srv.sh copies the current one), zz_count.js.
# Rows: s2_B.qb rows that were batch faults or OPEN (SQ-RD-10, SQ-WCD-07, SQ-WCD-02, SQ-RD-26), with more villages,
# every warm_dry farm crop counted, second jungle / beach / savanna located away from spawn, fixed biometag names.
# Same seed as s2b, so the spawn-nearest hits repeat r1102b s2's (savanna village -1459 826, jungle -1616 -302, beach
# -80 50); the new hits come from `execute positioned X 70 Z run locate ...` far from them.
# Locates may be async (Async Locator): every capture waits for its "is at [" line first. Setup: r_setup.md, boot 2.
pace 2

## SQ-RD-10 | village farm crops: log line; savanna farms get warm_dry crops (three villages, every group crop counted)
# village_farms.json: a field is replaced with chance 0.35 by one of 11 warm_dry crops, so cotton alone is about 3% of
# fields (the queue's "about 25%" is stale). Pass = some warm_dry crop in a savanna village farm.
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] village farm crops added to [1-9]\d* pool elements of \d+ listed farm templates$
bootreject village farm crops .*failed
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> weather clear 100000
> locate structure minecraft:village_savanna
waitlog is at \[ 600
capture VS is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
# the later locates print the same text: each waitlog skips the hits already captured (variables are substituted in
# waitlog patterns), and capture takes the last matching line, i.e. the new one
> execute positioned 3000 70 3000 run locate structure minecraft:village_savanna
waitlog The nearest minecraft:village_savanna is at \[(?!{VS1}, ~, {VS3}\])-?\d+, 600
capture VT The nearest minecraft:village_savanna is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> execute positioned -3000 70 3000 run locate structure minecraft:village_savanna
waitlog The nearest minecraft:village_savanna is at \[(?!{VS1}, ~, {VS3}\])(?!{VT1}, ~, {VT3}\])-?\d+, 600
capture VU The nearest minecraft:village_savanna is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {VS1-48} {VS3-48} {VS1+48} {VS3+48}
> forceload add {VT1-48} {VT3-48} {VT1+48} {VT3+48}
> forceload add {VU1-48} {VU3-48} {VU1+48} {VU3+48}
sleep 120
> zq count {VS1-56} 40 {VS3-56} {VS1+56} 160 {VS3+56} minecraft:wheat
waitlog \[zq\] count minecraft:wheat 300
> zq count {VS1-56} 40 {VS3-56} {VS1+56} 160 {VS3+56} farmersdelight:cabbages
> zq count {VS1-56} 40 {VS3-56} {VS1+56} 160 {VS3+56} farmersdelight:onions
