expect \[zq\] count rusticdelight:wild_coffee: [1-9]
expect \[zq\] count rusticdelight:wild_cotton: [1-9]
expect biometag creativedelight:wild_crops/bell_pepper \([1-9]\d*\): .*jungle
reject biometag creativedelight:wild_crops/giant_bell_pepper \(\d+\): .*jungle
look jungle box (near 2500 -2500): wild bell peppers and wild coffee, no giant pepper; savanna box (9 x 9 chunks): wild cotton, giant peppers rare (0 or 1 patch is normal); r1102b s2's spawn jungle had wild_bell_peppers 0: a second 0 here with the bell_pepper tag naming jungle biomes is a finding

## SQ-RD-22 | rerun after gen_comfort_nourishment.py (19:50): Calamari Soup keeps Nourishment (fresh kubejs copy)
> zq food rusticdelight:calamari_soup
> zq food rusticdelight:fried_dough
expect food rusticdelight:calamari_soup: .*farmersdelight:nourishment amp 0 \d+t
look duration against kubejs/generation_scripts/food/comfort_nourishment.json (generator says 240 s = 4800t; Rustic's own value 3600t)
